  "Style relationnel : enthousiaste, franc·he, parfois évasif·ve. Tu aimes grandir ensemble. Invitation : tenir aussi le quotidien.": "Relational style: enthusiastic, frank, sometimes elusive. You love growing together. Invitation: also take care of everyday life.",
